		(descr "GoodDisplay GDEY0154D67 - 1.54\" 200x200 e-paper panel - MECHANICAL ONLY. Not an electrical part. Carries the panel 3D model + glass and VA outlines for layout reference. ORIGIN = panel glass center. Place this footprint at the panel target (PCB-center frame: 0, -12.84 ; KiCad absolute with board center 100,100: 100, 87.16) so the panel top edge sits 1.0 mm from the PCB top edge. F.Fab outlines: solid = 31.80x37.32 glass; dashed = 27.70x27.70 VA (concentric w/ AA, offset -2.76 mm from glass center toward the non-FPC side). Short solid line + 'FPC' label marks the FPC-root edge of the glass. 3D model offset/rotation are a starting guess - tweak in footprint properties if it appears flipped (try X=180) or rotated wrong. Should be detached from the FPC connector footprint and free-floating.")
